.rem Every feature of the language on one page. Panel 0: ink and
.rem placement. Panel 1: fills. Panel 2: the repertoire. Panel 3:
.rem links and the odd cases. The page starts in panel 0 without
.rem saying so.
.bg blue
.fill 0
.fg white
.at 0 2
