.at 2
rules    ─────── │ │ │
arrows   ← ↑ → ↓
blocks   ░ ▒ ▓ █
symbols  ° ± × ÷ • ·
ascii    A-Z a-z 0-9 !"#$%&'()*
         ,-./:;<=>?@\^_`{|}~
euro     € 12 · pound £ 9
weather  ☀ ☁ ☂ ☾ ❄ ↯ ⚠
typo     ‘quote’ “quote” 1–2 — x
marks    ☺ ☹ ♥ ★ ✓ ✗
status   ● on  ○ off
